# Day 12 – Prompt Templates & Variables

## What is a Prompt Template?

A Prompt Template is a reusable prompt with blank spaces (variables) that you can fill in for different tasks.

## What is a Variable?

Variables are the parts of a prompt that can be changed.

## Why are Prompt Templates useful?

It is because it saves our time.
#mistake - Prompt Templates are useful because they save time and allow us to reuse the same prompt for different tasks by changing only the variables.

